            },
            "description": "Admin endpoint. Enables VAT for a course. Supported aliases in create/update payloads: vatEnabled, vatIncluded, vatEligible, hasVat, chargeVat, and isVatEnabled. VAT-enabled bookings store the VAT breakdown and charge the gross total."
          },
